            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91039605?u=75d9215ac93cf8524615e7259f3f7ec619bc564e&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #40767.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3328690490\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40767\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40767/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40767\">#40767</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Hello,<br>\nThe MDN documentation was missing crucial info about what happens when you mix different ways of adding event listeners to the same element.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To prevent developers from wasting hours debugging event handler conflicts.</p>",
